---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – Astro SaaS Launcher">

<section class="py-40 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6">

    <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[0.9] text-[#0F172A] mb-12">
      Privacy Policy<br />
      <span class="inline-block -rotate-1 px-3 bg-[#A259FF] text-white">
        Your data matters.
      </span>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-xl max-w-none text-[#1E293B]">

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website or purchase Astro SaaS Launcher (“the product”).
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Purchase information:</strong> When you buy the product, Stripe collects your payment details. We do not store or see your card information.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> If you contact us, we receive the information you submit (name, email, message).</li>
        <li><strong>Basic analytics:</strong> We may use privacy‑friendly analytics to understand website usage without tracking personal identities.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To deliver the product you purchased</li>
        <li>To provide customer support</li>
        <li>To improve our website and product</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">4. Payments</h2>
      <p>
        All payments are processed securely by Stripe. We do not store or have access to your credit card information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">5. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties, except as required to process payments or comply with legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your information, but no online service is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to your data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">8. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We may use minimal, privacy‑friendly cookies for analytics or essential site functionality. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us through the contact page.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

